WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,097 --> 00:00:01,365
Oh no!

2
00:00:01,317 --> 00:00:05,765
Remy wants to put a box inside Sammy, but Sammy is locked!

3
00:00:05,765 --> 00:00:09,216
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:09,216 --> 00:00:11,265
This is Episode 40.

5
00:00:11,265 --> 00:00:13,675
Remy is only visiting today.

6
00:00:13,675 --> 00:00:16,042
Maya could give him a name tag.

7
00:00:16,042 --> 00:00:18,729
But a name tag lasts forever.

8
00:00:18,729 --> 00:00:21,500
Remy is only here until sunset.

9
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,738
So Maya gives him a sunset pass instead.

10
00:00:24,738 --> 00:00:26,479
She sticks it on.

11
00:00:26,479 --> 00:00:27,604
Click!

12
00:00:27,604 --> 00:00:29,335
Sammy opens.

13
00:00:29,335 --> 00:00:31,766
Remy puts his box inside.

14
00:00:31,766 --> 00:00:32,892
Click!

15
00:00:32,892 --> 00:00:34,537
Sammy locks.

16
00:00:34,537 --> 00:00:36,417
The sun goes down.

17
00:00:36,417 --> 00:00:39,612
The pass fades and peels off by itself.

18
00:00:39,612 --> 00:00:41,258
It floats away.

19
00:00:41,258 --> 00:00:43,477
Nobody had to take it back.

20
00:00:43,477 --> 00:00:45,664
The badge is who you become.

21
00:00:45,664 --> 00:00:48,212
The pass is how long it lasts.

22
00:00:48,212 --> 00:00:54,253
That is STS: a visitor key that expires by itself, so nothing is left behind.

23
00:00:54,253 --> 00:00:58,001
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

